<p>Heighten the fears of those near to you. Any foe you attempt to inflict a fear upon and who remains in a radius of 8 and in sight of you for 4 (non-consecutive) turns, will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">14, 19, 23, 26, 29</acronym> mind and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">14, 19, 23, 26, 29</acronym> darkness damage and gain a new fear that lasts for 8 turns.</p><p>This effect completely ignores fear resistance, but can be saved against.</p>